WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.650
It may be a faint dream, but let me see it
Hakanaki yume saredo yume misete

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.190
I'm in a complete daze under the sun
Konmei ryouran ni under the sun wow wow

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.920
Guided only by my flowering love for you
Konmei ryouran ni do ai do wow wow

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.530
Let the flower of life bloom
Hirakeyo inochi no hana

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.390
Let it follow its red hot desires
Akaku atsuku midasarete

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.550
This flame runs through the pulses
Fujouri na mirai no kodou

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Of the absurd future
Kakenukeru honoo

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.450
I feel so guilty for devoting myself to earning your love
Aisaretakute kono mi sasageru tsumibukasa ga

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.570
I feel it tingling inside me
Watashi no naka de jirijiri shiteru ne

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.070
Desire
Yokubou

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:45.780
A bolt of lightning that brings about tomorrow
Sore wa ashita wo maneku inazuma

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:50.700
And turns into great pleasure
Yagate tsuyoi yorokobi ni naru

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:56.540
I'm sure you don't know yet
Mada shiranai hazu anata wa kitto

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.300
It's cruel when you can't even have a faint dream
Hakanaki yume saredo yume minu hibi wa mugoi yo

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:08.260
I want to hold on to these newborn desires
Umaretate no negai wo tada dakishimete itai

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.560
More wild than soft
Yasashii yori mo hageshiku ne

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.730
That will make my day
Sore de ima ga michite kuru sa

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:21.270
Who is going to protect this world (this dangerous world)
Michibikarete tashikameru sekai wa (ayaui sekai wa)

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:23.190
That I can only see for myself?
Dare ga mamoru

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:29.700
I can do it, so love me truly
Mamoreru dakara honki de ai shiteyo

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.490
<b>Party</b>

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:33.120
Cheers!

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:34.620
<b>Party</b>

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.380
<b>Super-Party</b>

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:45.130
Who gave her booze?

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:47.760
I'm impressed she can be so carefree.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:52.680
Kanetsugu, come dance with me!

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.560
Why should I?

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:01.400
She's reaching heights she's never reached before!

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:16.120
What's wrong, Yagyuu Juubei?

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:19.000
Not a fan of parties?

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.960
Why are you doing this?

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.340
Why?

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:27.220
Well, if I had to sum it up,

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:30.510
just because I want to, I guess.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:35.450
You seem to relax better when you're alone.

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.350
Hey, Maeda Keiji!

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.630
What are you plotting?

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:43.400
Could you tell us why you wanted to hold a party?

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.980
Oh, right.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:50.150
Try transforming in front of the camera!

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:52.780
I'll show you something cool.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:55.910
<b>Inspection</b>

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:04.960
Right here.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:07.000
W-Wow!

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.930
Oh, so you get it?

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:12.590
You're actually controlling qi subconsciously.

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:17.100
My life for the greater good! Sanada Yukimura!

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:22.600
You concentrate by exclaiming words you can identify the most with,

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:25.430
and you become Master Samurai by gathering qi.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.820
I see.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:29.320
This is the problem.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.450
What do you mean?

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:36.950
How do you return back to normal?

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.950
How? I don't know.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:41.080
Once the battle is over, it just naturally dissolves.

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:43.690
See, that's it.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:47.840
Gathering qi is difficult, but letting go of it is easy.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:52.470
Simply put, a little relaxation can do it.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:54.260
I see!

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:56.130
So that's why you threw a party yesterday?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.450
You wanted to help Juubei relax?

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.220
But she hasn't changed back yet!

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:05.480
Right now, she's like a bike with its engine on full throttle.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.030
In order for her to stop before running out of gas,

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.990
she must master controlling qi.

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:13.400
It'll be tough...

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.240
but I guess you don't really mind, do you?

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.080
You're there, aren't you?

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:20.790
That's just what I want.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.370
Teach me too!

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:27.420
I won't teach a man.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.220
But I don't care if you watch.

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.550
Teach <i>us</i>, then!

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:36.340
Teach us how to use qi!

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:39.850
I'm not against teaching you,

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:42.850
but I've got one condition.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.350
<b>Condition</b>

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:54.280
Why do we have to dress like this for training?

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:56.410
It's humiliating!

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:57.780
It really is!

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:01.540
What's on her mind?

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:03.330
This is Keiji we're talking about.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:05.790
There must be something behind it.

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:07.190
Huh?

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:09.460
When she appeared disguised as Kanetsugu,

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:14.840
she pretended to get in our way, but she was actually training us.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:19.430
The same applies to yesterday's party.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:21.760
She had an ulterior motive.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.600
So you think there's some deep meaning to dressing up like this too?

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:28.350
Nope. This is just a fetish of mine.

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:30.480
<b>Training 1</b>

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:37.240
First: meditate!

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:40.240
We tried doing that before!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.620
Just "let's try concentrating" won't do.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.120
If you can perfectly control the qi in your body,

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:51.750
then you can stand steady on any unstable footing.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:55.510
Kind of like this.

00:05:56.740 --> 00:06:01.890
First, you have to meditate while sitting on these.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:07.390
It's really difficult!

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:10.980
Not bad.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:14.860
This is the last time you get to act cocky.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.280
Housekeeping!

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.740
Outta the way!

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:23.740
Gotcha!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:28.210
Huh?

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.630
K-Kanetsugu...

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.920
<b>Training 2</b>

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:41.680
Once you can control the qi in your body,

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:42.140
Training. Don't peek!

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:42.550
you have to learn how to use it outside your body.
Training. Don't peek!

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.930
I won't peek! I promise!
you have to learn how to use it outside your body.
Training. Don't peek!

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.520
If you cover your body in it,

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.440
then there won't be a bath too hot for you.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:53.860
All right, heat it up!

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:54.570
Right!

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:00.070
It's hot!

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:05.200
Now allow me to give you what you need!

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:09.370
I'm going to get them this time!

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:18.880
It's hot!

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:24.640
It's hot!

00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:30.230
What are you doing, Kanetsugu?

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:32.270
<b>Training 3</b>

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:36.270
Qi is present in everything in this world.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:39.900
You must next learn how to feel the qi outside of you.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.900
It's too cold to concentrate!

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:42.660
Yeah!

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:45.910
The qi in water is especially easy to feel.

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:51.140
That's why standing under a
waterfall serves as qi training.

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.230
I see.

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:54.790
I'll do it for real this time.

00:07:57.550 --> 00:08:00.790
You'll pay, Maeda Keiji!

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:04.430
Even a chestnut tree is making a fool of me?!

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:10.430
I'll teach you a lesson, you damn chestnut!

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:22.570
If you can feel the qi in each drop of water,

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:25.950
you will be able to feel other qi as well.

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:28.580
This includes dangerous objects falling with the water.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:33.120
That's when you repel it with your own qi!

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:34.830
There!

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:35.710
I can feel it!

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:36.580
A strange qi!

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:46.300
Oh, it was just Kanetsugu.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.340
What's she doing?

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:53.150
No, really. What are you doing, Kanetsugu?

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.120
Sorry, Gisen!

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:19.570
There's no need for an apology.

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:25.630
It's clear which path we should tread now that we're in this situation.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.850
Gisen, you should train with us too.

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:34.390
There's something you want to get back, isn't there?

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:37.190
Let's work together.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.520
<b>Dark Samurai</b>

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.340
I see you're moody today.

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:03.590
I don't like to be made a fool of.

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:07.590
I won't let that dandy get away again.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:10.970
Go and find her then, dammit.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:13.180
Otherwise,

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:16.980
I'll end up chopping one of you up!

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:19.310
Have you found anything, Inshun?

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.570
Her name is Maeda Keiji.

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:27.250
Maeda... Keiji?

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.070
Where is she?

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.280
The Yagyuu dojo.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.450
There, huh?

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:32.870
She must be teaching them about qi.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:35.810
Also, she's back.

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:36.810
Who is?

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:37.710
The real one.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.120
<b>In training</b>

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:45.840
Amazing!

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.510
She hasn't moved an inch.

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:50.010
M-My...

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:53.510
Juubei-san's qi is...

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:56.870
Don't shout while someone is training.

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:59.020
What do you think, Juubei?

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.550
Can you return to your normal form again?

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.280
Let me give it a try.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.410
Was it still too early?

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:20.790
Juubei! Juubei!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.290
Get a hold of yourself! Juubei!

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:29.420
What's going on?

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:34.430
I told you, she's like a bike on full throttle that can't turn off.

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:36.930
If she keep racing on...

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.350
she'll eventually break down.

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:42.370
So you're saying Juubei's going to die?

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.190
Can we do nothing to help?

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:49.940
There's always something we can do.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.320
Someone must pour qi into her.

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:55.910
Give her... qi?

00:11:56.450 --> 00:12:00.410
But that'd still only buy her some time.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:02.830
If you keep pouring qi into her,

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.790
eventually your own qi will run out, and then...

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:08.300
...it's game over.

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:15.300
Not to mention this method
requires a bond of utmost trust.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.720
That means that it must be done by her General.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.560
Muneakira!

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.310
What will you do?

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:26.610
Can you throw away your life to save hers?

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.860
How can you even ask that?

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.320
It's my duty as General.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.700
You're quite a dandy yourself, huh?

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:56.950
What's wrong, Yagyuu Muneakira?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:00.130
Weren't you training behind my back?!

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:10.690
What perfect timing...

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:14.950
This isn't good.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:17.280
He's gonna use up all his qi this way.

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:18.240
What?!

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.250
We need to give our qi to him, then!

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:22.700
Yeah!

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:23.790
Don't!

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:25.850
Why?

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:29.450
You haven't mastered qi yet.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:32.500
While you may intend to give him some,
you may end up taking his.

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:36.260
But if we don't do something,
Muneakira's going to kick the bucket!

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.510
I guess that leaves me.

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:44.600
We're not General and Master Samurai,

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.020
but I can still do it better than you two.

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.130
But...

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:50.480
Don't you hate men?

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:51.690
Yeah.

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:54.150
But I enjoy crazies like him.

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:56.430
Let's do this, Muneakira!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.030
Okay!

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:02.790
I don't wanna touch you for too long, so I'll give it to you all at once.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.190
Be sure to take it!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.750
Extreme power is flowing into my body!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:14.330
Take care of the rest...

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.110
Keiji!

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:20.340
Are you okay?

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:21.180
Is something wrong?

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:24.430
No, it's nothing.

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:27.180
It's just that I used too much qi at once.

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:31.930
I just need to get some air.

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:36.990
Did I give him too much?

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:39.570
I guess I won't survive this then.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.830
Muneakira?

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:48.910
Juubei. Control your qi now...

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.960
and return to your normal form!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:51.850
Very well.

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:01.840
I can't let you pass.

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.750
Look at how cool she is!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.060
I don't know what happened,

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:09.600
but it seems you've used up your qi.

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.980
You're here looking for me, aren't you?

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:16.480
Yeah, we had business with you previously.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:19.740
Not with your current state.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:24.240
You know me better than that.

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:25.910
Get lost.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:27.240
We're only looking for strong ones.

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.290
I guess you <i>are</i> looking for me, then.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:32.750
Do it, Juubei!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:33.880
Control your qi!

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:36.250
I... know...

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:43.050
You're weak now! We've got no business with you!

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:44.140
We're not done yet.

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:49.310
You're no match against us without your qi.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.990
Remember the training!

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.560
You can do it!

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:07.700
Do it, Juubei!

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.200
You have to do it, Juubei!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:11.960
Juubei!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.350
That was pathetic.

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:16.960
A better fight lies right up ahead.

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:19.340
Let's get going, then.

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:25.050
We're not done yet.

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:27.680
Know when to give up!

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.730
Muneakira, get away from her!

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:30.830
You're at your limit!

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:34.190
Stop it! You're going to kill yourself!

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:37.330
Not yet. I can't give up just yet!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:40.150
This is bad! Muneakira's qi is fading.

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:42.590
Yukimura, can't we do anything?

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:43.700
Muneakira's dying!

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:46.200
Oh, right. Kiss!

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:50.700
Yeah. Muneakira's power as a General!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.810
Muneakira! Kiss!

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.210
Give her your qi by kissing her!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:56.460
Very well.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:01.960
Juubei, feel the last of my qi.

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:12.220
What's this?

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:16.230
This heartwarming light emitting from me.

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:24.890
Is it Muneakira?

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.490
And those two.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.670
I see.

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:33.250
The world is full of qi.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:35.000
Thank you.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:38.830
Thanks to you I feel like I can take back my power.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:46.260
Dead yet?

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:49.090
You're going too far.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:50.390
Let's go.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.350
She can still move after taking a direct hit from me?

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:56.270
Enough. I'll kill her.

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.150
I won't let you pass, even if it costs me my life.

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:05.400
Then you'll die here!

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:14.370
Finally! It took you long enough.

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.630
I'm back, Onii-chan.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.000
Welcome home, Juubei.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.830
Onii-chan!

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.290
I'm so glad, Juubei!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.010
You did it, Juubei!

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:32.550
Wh-What?

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:33.850
The qi's gone.

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:36.810
D-Dammit!

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:40.850
Leave, Dark Samurai!

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:42.860
You shall not pass!

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:45.360
Damn small fry!

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:48.110
Give me Yagyuu Juubei!

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:50.190
N-No way.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.820
This feeling...

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.410
You made Musashi angry.

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:55.910
You're really foolish.

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.080
If you know what's good for you, you'll get out of my way.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.080
Wait!

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.070
The deadline's not here yet!

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.210
You want to break your word?

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:09.440
I just want to fight the real Yagyuu Juubei.

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:12.470
If she's back, then we're gonna fight!

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:15.350
Give me Yagyuu Juubei!

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.520
Yagyuu Juubei <i>did</i> return.

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:23.480
However, we've got no qi left to fight.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:25.360
He's telling the truth.

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:29.150
If you want to fight a truly strong Juubei,

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:30.240
you'll have to come back later.

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:35.990
She doesn't have the power she used to defeat Amakusa.

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:39.970
She'll have it back by the time your deadline comes around.

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.310
We can promise you that.

00:19:41.310 --> 00:19:43.000
So wait a little longer!

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:45.170
What should we do?

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:50.630
They sure don't look like they have the power that defeated Amakusa.

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:53.590
Should we just tease the weaklings and leave?

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:55.680
Very well.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:59.180
We'll wait until the promised day.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:03.230
But be sure to get your power back.

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:04.980
Understood?

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.230
Yes.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:13.730
What's going on?

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.160
What's with the luxurious breakfast?

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:18.270
It's our sign of gratitude to Keiji-san.

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:21.330
I can't let her have this!

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:23.460
I'll eat it instead!

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:27.450
Maedake-san's late.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.430
Maedake?

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:30.260
She must mean Keiji.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.490
You've still got a messed up sense of names.

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:38.930
But is she <i>really</i> still sleeping?

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:40.270
I wouldn't be surprised.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.640
It's a miracle that she even survived.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.940
You won't believe this!

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:45.940
Keiji-san...

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:48.410
Keiji-san's gone!

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:49.690
What?!

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:53.450
Don't tell me she left with those wounds?

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:57.530
You gonna leave?

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:58.660
Yeah.

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:00.080
I've already done what I came here to do.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:03.990
You came all this way just to teach them about q-

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.950
Whatever feelings I have toward the government,

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.710
I can honestly say I love this country.

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.000
And for the sake of protecting it...

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:16.050
You should be a little more honest, you know.

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:25.480
Later!

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.740
Episode Seven

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:15.210
Sen, I get the feeling that we don't stand out enough.

00:23:15.210 --> 00:23:19.170
There are more side characters this season.

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:22.430
The Dark Samurai, Sasuke, Keiji...

00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:25.670
And then, next episode we'll have to face a stranger danger again.

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:27.950
<i>Another</i> new character? Give me a break!

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:30.290
We should get rid of some old characters, then!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:32.980
Our first candidate is, of course...

00:23:32.980 --> 00:23:34.520
Kanetsugu!

00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:38.390
Next time: A Mysterious Shadow

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:39.990
Was that the new character?
